{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793088226","published":"2026-10-27T14:36:18Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:15:59.396405123Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-14662","CVE-2026-14670","CVE-2026-14671","CVE-2026-14677","CVE-2026-14680","CVE-2026-15742","CVE-2026-16239","CVE-2026-18408","CVE-2026-2005"],"summary":"postgresql: Fix of 9 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2026-14662: harden tsvector/tsquery code against overflows\n- CVE-2026-14670: harden PL/Perl code against tied arrays and hashes\n- CVE-2026-14671: remove the refint plan cache\n- CVE-2026-14677: avoid allocation size overflows in PL/Tcl and PL/Perl\n- CVE-2026-14680: reject SQL calls to functions taking or returning type internal\n- CVE-2026-15742: avoid overflow in Levenshtein distance calculations\n- CVE-2026-16239: cross-check the result type of a portal running EXECUTE or FETCH\n- CVE-2026-18408: do not expand backquotes in psql \\unrestrict\n- CVE-2026-2005: fix buffer overflow in pgcrypto pgp_pub_decrypt_bytea()\n- Build for cloudlinux7els\n- Apply the PST-to-LMT timezone regression test adjustment only on\n  cloudlinux7els (cl7els): its build root's tzdata reports LMT, while the\n  centos7els, oraclelinux7els and rhel7els build roots report PST again","affected":[{"package":{"name":"postgresql","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:7","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql?distro=centos-7"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"9.2.24-9.0.7.el7_9.tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos7els/CLSA-2026-1793088226.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-contrib","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:7","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql-contrib?distro=centos-7"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"9.2.24-9.0.7.el7_9.tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos7els/CLSA-2026-1793088226.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-de